<span id="A1.F12.pic1.p4.pic1.p1.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F12.pic1.p4.pic1.p1.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">“verdict”:</span> “BAD”</span>
